{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉早上9時開始投票。截至下午2時，投票率93.55%，5341名選民投票。<br/>\n<br/>\n多個界別的投票率都達到100%，包括商界（第三）、科技創新界、工業界（第一）、會計界，及法律界。<br/>\n<br/>\n投票率最低是金融界，有69.12%，47人已投票，界別選民人數有68人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:23:53.232506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:17:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:25.816269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:25.816269+00:00","content_hash":"bf6a3442fda7cff27f4060d46c6445829a46d4599cf520aef7fa5443c9449339","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}